{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": [
    "Shared scene matrix for the cross-framework pixel-fidelity harness.",
    "Klaxon (zig build fidelity) and the Compose runner (fidelity/compose)",
    "BOTH read this file and render fidelity/out/<side>/<scene_id>.ppm.",
    "state: default|hover|pressed|focused|disabled. pressed = pointer held",
    "at the widget center (nav_bar/tabs: the middle destination/tab).",
    "disabled ALSO sets options.enabled=false. theme: light|dark (M3",
    "baseline roles). dir: ltr|rtl. viewport: [w,h] logical px at density",
    "1.0; the widget is centered in it. t_ms: the virtual-timeline",
    "timestamp rendered (animations sampled at t_ms after a lazy start at",
    "0). nav_bar/tabs carry options.items[{icon,label}] — the Klaxon",
    "runner builds nav_bar.destination / icon+text columns; the Compose",
    "runner builds matching NavigationBarItem/Tab content. card carries",
    "children[] (registry-serialized subtree). Icon names map to Unicode",
    "codepoints (src/widgets/icon.zig) — Compose draws the same codepoint",
    "in the pinned DejaVu Sans."
  ],
